     "titulo": "Parts of the body",
     "texto": [
      "**Picior** can mean «foot» or «leg», depending on the context. **Spate** is «back» and **măsea**, «molar»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying what is wrong",
     "texto": [
      "**Îmi curge nasul** means «my nose is running». The pronoun **îmi** goes before the verb, and in English we use «my» instead."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
